WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:01.801
-Welcome back.

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.200
I'm so excited

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.334
because this weekend is
the Final Four.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:07.601
It is happening down in Houston.

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:10.501
You have Florida Atlantic
taking on San Diego State

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:13.601
and UConn facing off
against Miami, yeah.

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:15.033
[ Cheering ]
It is impossible to predict

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.133
who's going to go all the way,
but you're in luck

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.767
because, when it comes
to predicting things,

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:19.868
we have a secret weapon

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:20.934
-[ Squeaking ]
-and it's puppies.

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:22.100
[ Cheering and applause ]
It's time for

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.434
the Puppy Predictors 2023
Final Four Edition.

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:30.601
-♪ Puppy Predictors ♪

00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:34.467
♪ Puppy Predictors ♪

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.901
-Welcome to the Puppy Predictors
2023 Final Four Edition.

00:00:37.901 --> 00:00:39.934
Here's how it works --
we have four puppies,

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:43.000
one for each team,
and one bowl of kibble.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.501
Whichever team's puppy gets
to the bowl first

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:48.734
will determine who will be
crowned the national champs.

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:51.534
Now, let's meet the puppies.

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:53.634
-[ Squeaking ]

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:56.100
-For Florida Atlantic, we have

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.901
Donna Braylon.

00:00:57.901 --> 00:01:00.834
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:03.033
[ Drumroll ]
For San Diego State, we have

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.701
Kyle McAdams.

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:07.367
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.267
For UConn, we have

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.400
Ted Mooney.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:16.167
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Laughs ]

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.434
The square's not tall enough
for the puppies?

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:19.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.067
And for Miami, we have

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:23.534
Gary Frick Jr. right there,
everybody.

00:01:23.534 --> 00:01:25.133
[ Laughs ]

00:01:25.133 --> 00:01:25.901
[ Rimshot ]
My God.

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:27.834
But first --

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:29.067
But first, Gary.

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:31.133
Alright, now, look,
before I release you guys,

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:32.267
I need you to listen up, okay?

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:33.300
-[ Squeaking ]
-Pay attention. Thank you.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:34.367
Not yet.
Gary,

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:36.000
I want to see
a clean race, okay?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.667
[ Laughter ]
I don't want to see
any wandering.

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:41.033
No, peeing,
no butt sniffing, okay?

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.167
You ready for this?

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:43.934
You ready, bud?
Ooh, I have a feeling.

00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:45.234
Oh, I have a feeling.
Hi, bud.

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:46.567
[ Awws ]
Alright. I have a feeling.

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:47.701
Alright, let's do it.

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:49.267
Release the puppies!

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:51.400
[ Lullaby plays ]
Oh, here they go.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.667
[ Cheering and applause ]
Oh, could be it.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:53.567
Ooh, Miami's got a lead.

00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:55.868
No, San Diego State.

00:01:55.868 --> 00:01:56.534
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:57.467
That is -- No.

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:58.534
Yes! The winner!

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:01.300
[ Bell dinging ]
San Diego State!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.100
[ Rimshot ]
We have a winner.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.334
Wow. This is a nice puppy
right here.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:07.334
San Diego State
is the winner right there.

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:08.968
Congratulations.

00:02:08.968 --> 00:02:10.100
You will be crowned

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.834
the 2023 national champions
right there.

00:02:12.834 --> 00:02:14.234
Guys, you heard it here first.

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:15.767
Enjoy the Final Four.

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:18.400
We'll be right back
with Edward Norton, everyone.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.133
[ Cheering and applause ]
Hey, bud.

